{"id":"6de792e2a935524d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class.md","title":"ZFC Fixed Point Class","display":"df-zfc-fixed-point-class — ZFC Fixed Point Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class"],"display":"df-zfc-fixed-point-class — ZFC Fixed Point Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fixed-point-class — ZFC Fixed Point Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,C\">\\(F,C\\)</span> (class variables in the two-sorted metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FixedPointClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FixedPointClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{FixedPointClass}_S(C,F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in F)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{FixedPointClass}_S(C,F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in F)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is represented as a definable class of ordered pairs with a unique value at every set, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is exactly its diagonal fixed-point class.</li>\n<li>Proper classes are not elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> are therefore class-sort variables rather than set-valued “class codes.”</li>\n<li>This removes the unsourced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassFunction}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassFunction}\\)</span> predicate and the incompatible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Class}\">\\(\\operatorname{Class}\\)</span> spelling.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (definable-class predicate, see [[58-df-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"F,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FixedPointClass}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{FixedPointClass}_S(C,F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(F)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in F)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClassFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Class}","display":false}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1937","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class.md|58-df-zfc-fixed-point-class]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}